454 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Air pollution is a major environmental and public health issue in Nairobi, causing around 2,500 premature deaths annually. Key pollution sources include vehicle emissions, industrial activities, open waste burning, and dust from construction. Despite existing environmental laws, the lack of comprehensive and enforceable air quality regulations has led to ineffective pollution control and rising health risks.)
/E (Air pollution is a major environmental and public health issue in Nairobi, causing around 2,500 premature deaths annually. Key pollution sources include vehicle emissions, industrial activities, open waste burning, and dust from construction. Despite existing environmental laws, the lack of comprehensive and enforceable air quality regulations has led to ineffective pollution control and rising health risks.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
455 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The Breathe Cities initiative, delivered by Clean Air Fund, C40 Cities, and Bloomberg Philanthropies is working with Nairobi City County to develop tailored air quality regulations aligned with national and international standards. These regulations aim to set clear pollution limits, establish monitoring systems, and strengthen enforcement. Implementing them is vital for improving public health, supporting sustainable urban development, and fostering a cleaner, greener Nairobi.)
/E (The Breathe Cities initiative, delivered by Clean Air Fund, C40 Cities, and Bloomberg Philanthropies is working with Nairobi City County to develop tailored air quality regulations aligned with national and international standards. These regulations aim to set clear pollution limits, establish monitoring systems, and strengthen enforcement. Implementing them is vital for improving public health, supporting sustainable urban development, and fostering a cleaner, greener Nairobi.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
